      "summary": "# Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Issue Identified**: Vue warning about extraneous `class` attribute passed to `ProjectDetailt` component that cannot inherit it due to fragment/teleport root nodes structure.\n\n2. **Root Cause**: The `ProjectDetailt` component's internal structure (fragment or teleport) prevents automatic class attribute inheritance from parent components.\n\n3. **Temporary Solution Provided**: Wrapped `ProjectDetailt` with a parent `div` applying the `w-full` class to the wrapper instead of the component itself.\n\n4. **Information Requested**: Asked for `ProjectDetailt.vue` and `ProjectSelectorContent.vue` file contents to implement a permanent fix.\n\n5. **Next Step**: Once files are provided, the component will be refactored to properly handle class attributes through explicit prop definitions or proper root element configuration.",
